msgid "Update"
msgstr "Actualización"

msgid "Today, we released Quarkus 3.3.2, our second maintenance release for our 3.3 release train."
msgstr ""

msgid "It includes a bunch of bugfixes, together with documentation improvements."
msgstr "Incluye una serie de correcciones de errores, junto con mejoras en la documentación."

msgid "The https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/issues/35406[startup performance/memory regression introduced in 3.3] mentioned in the 3.3.1 announcement should be fixed in this version."
msgstr ""

msgid "To update to Quarkus 3.3.2, we recommend updating to the latest version of the Quarkus CLI and run:"
msgstr ""

msgid "To migrate from 3.2, please refer to https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/wiki/Migration-Guide-3.3[our migration guide]."
msgstr "Para migrar desde la versión 3.2, por favor consulta https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/wiki/Migration-Guide-3.3[nuestra guía de migración]."

msgid ""
"If you are not already using 3.x, please refer to the https://quarkus.io/blog/quarkus-3-0-final-released/[3.0 announcement] for all the details.\n"
"You can also refer to https://quarkus.io/blog/quarkus-3-upgrade/[this blog post] for additional details.\n"
"Once you upgraded to 3.0, also have a look at the https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/wiki/Migration-Guide-3.1[3.1] and https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/wiki/Migration-Guide-3.2[3.2] migration guides."
msgstr ""

msgid "Full changelog"
msgstr "Registro completo de cambios"

msgid "You can get https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/releases/tag/3.3.2[the full changelog of 3.3.2 on GitHub]."
msgstr ""

msgid "Come Join Us"
msgstr "Únete a nosotros"

msgid "We value your feedback a lot so please report bugs, ask for improvements... Let's build something great together!"
msgstr "Valoramos mucho tus comentarios, así que por favor reporta errores, solicita mejoras... ¡Construyamos algo grandioso juntos!"

msgid "If you are a Quarkus user or just curious, don't be shy and join our welcoming community:"
msgstr "Si eres un usuario de Quarkus o simplemente tienes curiosidad, no seas tímido y únete a nuestra acogedora comunidad:"

msgid "provide feedback on https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/issues[GitHub];"
msgstr "proporcionar retroalimentación en https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/issues[GitHub];"

msgid "craft some code and https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/pulls[push a PR];"
msgstr "escribir algo de código y enviar https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/pulls[push a PR];"

msgid "discuss with us on https://quarkusio.zulipchat.com/[Zulip] and on the https://groups.google.com/d/forum/quarkus-dev[mailing list];"
msgstr "comentar con nosotros en https://quarkusio.zulipchat.com/[Zulip] y en nuestra https://groups.google.com/d/forum/quarkus-dev[lista de correo];"

msgid "ask your questions on https://stackoverflow.com/questions/tagged/quarkus[Stack Overflow]."
msgstr "hacer tus preguntas en https://stackoverflow.com/questions/tagged/quarkus[Stack Overflow]."
